### =====================================================
### CUSTOMERS
### =====================================================

### Get all customers
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/main/Customers


### Get customer by ID
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/main/Customers(22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222)


### Create Customer
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/main/Customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerNumber": "CUS1001",
    "firstName": "Rahul",
    "lastName": "Sharma",
    "email": "rahulsharma@gmail.com",
    "phone": "+919876543210",
    "address": "Bangalore, Karnataka",
    "status": "Active"
}


### Update Customer
PATCH http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/main/Customers(22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222)
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "phone": "+919876543211",
    "address": "Bangalore, India"
}


### Delete Customer
DELETE http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/main/Customers(22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222)


